    "summary": "The user asks the assistant to help write a blog post favoring deregulation for startups. After the user expresses skepticism about the efficacy of \"smarter regulation\" and suggests it is often used as a loophole for big corporations, the assistant responds by suggesting the user advocate for enforcement and interpretation that is \"actively biased\" toward supporting small, disruptive startups.",
